 "_doc": "Polokwane Local Municipality eMunsoft-type 'Tax Invoice / Statement': header (Account Number, Account Date, Erf No, Street Address = site_name, DEPOSIT), Meter Readings table with a KVA row and an ELECTRICITY row (old/new reading, consumption, Levied Amount, reading period), and a ledger 'date code DESCRIPTION units tariff value' with an undated VAT line and a Sub Total. Electricity = 'TARIFF G LV KVA CHARGE' (demand kVA + Rands) + 'TARIFF G ELEC LV KWH ENERGY' (kWh + Rands) + 'TARIFF G LOW VOTAGE KVA CHARGE BASIC CH' and, when billed, 'TARIFF G ELECT LOW VOLT KWH CHARGE MIN' (both other_r); tariff_name = 'TARIFF x'. 'Bulk Meter Adjustment' lines (1 bill) are not labelled electricity and are left out. Fingerprint: the municipality's VAT number + its name. Identity (--identity pol_elec_check_r): the meter table's Levied Amounts for KVA and ELECTRICITY + basic + minimum vs the ledger: 0.00 on 7/7; checks 0. Checked on all 7 bills."
}